\"padding-top:0.5em;line-height:1.25em;font-size:90%;\"><div class=\"plainlist\" style=\"padding-left: 0.6em; text-align: left;\">\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color:#63B74E; color:; border:1px solid #000000; text-align:center;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span> US Allies</li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color:#2AACF6; color:; border:1px solid #000000; text-align:center;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span> <b>UPG </b></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color:#00FFFF; color:; border:1px solid #000000; text-align:center;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span> Mexican Allies</li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color:#C6BDC7; color:; border:1px solid #000000; text-align:center;\">&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;</span> Neutral powers</li></ul>\n</div>\n<hr />\n<div class=\"plainlist\" style=\"padding-left: 0.6em; text-align: left;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/2/25/Flag_of_Mexico_%282074%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/22?cb=20151031154418\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Mexico (2074).png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Mexico_%282074%29.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Mexico\" title=\"Mexico\">Mexico</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/5/5d/Venezuela.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/22?cb=20150826012837\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Venezuela.png\" data-image-key=\"Venezuela.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Venezuela\" title=\"Venezuela\">Venezuela</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Colombia.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Colombia.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/f/f8/Flag_of_Colombia.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/22?cb=20150826012927\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><span class=\"new\" title=\"Colombia (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ29sb21iaWE/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Colombia</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Peru (war).png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Peru_%28war%29.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/3/37/Flag_of_Peru_%28war%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/22?cb=20150815023431\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><span class=\"new\" title=\"Peru (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUGVydT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Peru</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Paraguay.png\" data-image-key=\"Paraguay.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/5/57/Paraguay.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/22?cb=20150826013051\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><span class=\"new\" title=\"Paraguay (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUGFyYWd1YXk/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Paraguay</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"22\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Argentina.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Argentina.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/8/8f/Flag_of_Argentina.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/22?cb=20150826013232\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Argentina\" title=\"Argentina\">Argentina</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Chile.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Chile.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/a/ae/Flag_of_Chile.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/22?cb=20170926160015\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><span class=\"new\" title=\"Chile (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQ2hpbGU/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Chile</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Bolivia.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Bolivia.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/5/56/Flag_of_Bolivia.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/22?cb=20170927003433\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><span class=\"new\" title=\"Bolivia (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQm9saXZpYT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Bolivia</span></li></ul>\n</div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Capital</b>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><i>Not specified</i>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Political structure</b>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Collective_security#Collective_defense\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Collective security\">Military alliance</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedtoprow\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"><b>Historical era</b>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Mexican-American_Cold_War\" title=\"Mexican-American Cold War\">Mexican-American Cold War</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0em;text-align:left;\">Established\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\">2091\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr class=\"mergedbottomrow\">\n<td style=\"width:1.0em; padding:0 0 0 0.6em;\">&#160;-&#160;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:0em;text-align:left;\">Disestablished\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: bottom;\">2139\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The&#160;<b>Union of Patria Grande</b> was an intergovernmental military and regional economic alliance between several Latin American states during the&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Mexican-American_Cold_War\" title=\"Mexican-American Cold War\">Mexican-American Cold War</a>. It held its origins as a direct successor to the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Union_of_South_American_Nations\">Union of South American Nations </a> before <a href=\"/wiki/World_War_III\" title=\"World War III\">World War III</a>.\n</p><p>The UPG constituted a system of collective defence whereby its member states agree to mutual defense in response to an attack by any external party. As an economic bloc the UPG included common regulatory and free trade policies observed by its members, as well as economic assistance and free travel for education.&#160;\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Origins\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Origins</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Creation_and_Cold_War\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Creation and Cold War</b></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Decline_and_Disbandment\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><b>Decline and Disbandment</b></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Members\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Members</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FLatin_American_Union%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table style=\"clear:right; float:right; width:15.0em; margin-left:1.0em; padding:0.2em; border:1px solid #000000; background:#f2f2f2; font-size:90%; text-align:center; line-height:1.4em;\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:white; font-size:85%; line-height:1.8em;\">\n<div style=\"padding-bottom:0.25em;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/9/90/Cold_War_Logo.png/revision/latest?cb=20171018054154\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Cold War Logo\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Cold War Logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Cold_War_Logo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/9/90/Cold_War_Logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/120?cb=20171018054154\" /></a></span></div>\n<p>Part of <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Mexican-American_Cold_War\" class=\"newcategory\" title=\"Category:Mexican-American Cold War\">a series</a> on the<br />\n<span style=\"font-size:125%;\"><b>History of the <a href=\"/wiki/Mexican-American_Cold_War\" title=\"Mexican-American Cold War\">Mexican-American Cold War</a></b></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding:0.2em 0.5em; background:#ccf;\">Origins\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0.2em 0.5em;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Second_Depression\" t